  "description": "Markdown processing server with tools for rendering, linting, parsing, and text extraction, optimized for Chinese publishing platforms like WeChat, Zhihu, and Juejin.",
  "github_stars": 602,
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "render",
      "title": "渲染 Markdown 为 HTML",
      "description": "将 Markdown 内容渲染为适用于不同平台的 HTML 片段。支持 GFM 语法、数学公式（KaTeX）、代码高亮，并自动将 CSS 样式内联到元素上，确保在微信公众号等富文本编辑器中正确显示。",
      "inputSchema": {
